:{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42281,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵世卿再至白沙","author":"陈献章","text":"脚底白云无定方，风流到处贺知章。\n这回却是无人见，走共渔翁酒处藏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42282,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茂卿评事惠扇答之","author":"陈献章","text":"远望不见大厓山，君家兄弟果皆难。\n不知风动今多少，也到先生掌握间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42283,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度楚云台前小桥","author":"陈献章","text":"一木欲度溪岸高，江门丈人放步牢。\n脚底太行开几片，秋风随处洒鸿毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42284,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用前韵答张直兄弟助修楚云台","author":"陈献章","text":"托契青莲意便高，千秋分付此台牢。\n先生醉拍藜床笑，笑杀杨朱靳一毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42285,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偕一之世卿诣楚云台偶作呈世卿 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"半床明月半床云，光景行窝到几分。\n眼角东溟秋一片，邵尧夫也不如君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42286,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代简奉寄邱明府","author":"陈献章","text":"何处思君独举杯，江门薄暮钓船回。\n风吹不尽寒蓑月，影过松间千丈来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c